---
import { contact } from '../lib/portfolio';
---
<section class="contact-section" id="contact"><div class="wrap contact-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">05 / LET’S TALK</p><h2>A good website starts <br/>with a conversation<span class="dot">.</span></h2><p>Tell me what your business offers, what visitors should do, which pages or features you need, and whether you have a logo, text and photos. Include your budget and desired launch date so I can prepare a written quote.</p><p class="contact-location">Based in Dubai. Working with people across the UAE.</p></div><div class="contact-options"><div><span class="eyebrow">LET’S DISCUSS YOUR PROJECT</span>{contact.email ? <a class="button light" href={`mailto:${contact.email}?subject=${encodeURIComponent('Website & visual identity enquiry')}`}>Email about your project ↗</a> : <>{contact.instagram && <a class="button light" href={contact.instagram}>Start a conversation on Instagram ↗</a>}<p class="contact-note">Business email coming soon.</p></>}</div><div class="email-option"><span>Find me on Instagram</span>{contact.instagram ? <a href={contact.instagram}>Under the Haik on Instagram ↗</a> : <p class="contact-note">Business Instagram will be connected here soon.</p>}</div><p class="contact-small">{!contact.email && !contact.instagram ? 'Enquiries are not connected yet.' : 'From your first message to a written quote, you speak directly with me.'}</p></div></div></section>
